sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as Apprenant / Candidat
    participant GW as API Gateway (8080)
    participant CodeExec as Code Execution Service (8083)
    participant Course as Course Service (8082)
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Docker Isolé (éphémère)
    participant Rabbit as RabbitMQ (Exchange: skillquest.events)

    Note over Student,Course: 1. Soumission & Chargement des Tests (Synchrone)
    Student->>GW: POST /api/submissions/submit (Code source, Langage, ExerciseId)
    GW->>CodeExec: Relaye la requête HTTP
    CodeExec->>Course: [REST Synchrone] GET /api/courses/:cId/exercises/:eId/test-cases
    Course-->>CodeExec: 200 OK (Liste assertions publiques & cachées)
    CodeExec-->>GW: 202 Accepted (submissionId)
    GW-->>Student: 202 Accepted

    Note over CodeExec,Sandbox: 2. Exécution Isolée & Mesures
    CodeExec->>Sandbox: Lancement conteneur éphémère (RAM: 128Mo, Timeout: 2s, Pas de réseau)
    Sandbox-->>CodeExec: Verdict (Temps: 42ms, Tous tests validés)

    Note over CodeExec,Rabbit: 3. Publication d'Événement Métier (Asynchrone)
    CodeExec->>Rabbit: [Événement Publié] CodeSolutionPassedEvent (code.solution.passed)
    Note over Rabbit: Consommé par Course Svc, Gamification Svc, Community Svc, Notif Svc
